<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it qualified for insurance six issues slated for competitive sale on Monday.</p>
<p>--Rockford, Ill., $13.2 million of GO refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Alexandria ISD #206, Minn., $13.8 million of GO refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Novi, Mich., $11.2 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Katy, Texas, $965,000 improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Wittenberg SD, Wis., $2.2 million of GO school improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Great Falls HSD, Mont., $5 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
